  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Registered Archive",
    "overview": "This portfolio behaves like a project register set on warm paper: firm columns, numbered entries, thin rules, and compact technical labels give the work a clear record. Oversized Cormorant Garamond headlines add an expressive editorial voice, while IBM Plex Sans and Mono keep explanations and metadata direct.\n\nThe canvas pairs an index with a generous project study. A brief orange registration shift marks a change of project; the accent stays deliberate, while the paper and near-black surfaces carry most of the page. Project compositions remain authored editorial studies made from documented facts until actual screenshots are supplied, and are identified as studies rather than product captures.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Asymmetric project index and canvas.",
      "Warm paper, near-black, and restrained vivid orange.",
      "Oversized serif headlines with compact mono metadata.",
      "Fine rules, numbered folios, and a short registration reveal."
    ],
    "rules": [
